<title>INDIA: India RBI keeps repo auction cut off at 5.0 pct.</title>
<headline>India RBI keeps repo auction cut off at 5.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it set the cut-off interest rate unchanged at 5.0 percent in Saturday's three-day repo auction.  </p>
<p>The RBI said it received 13 bids for 18.30 billion rupees of which it accepted 11 bids for 18.10 billion.</p>
<p>The average weighted rate was 4.9945 percent, it said.</p>
<p>The next repo auction is on March 12.</p>
<p>--Bombay Newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
</text>
